    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release a marble so that it fills circle after circle with glowing light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the light particles to win points, then use these points to buy more marbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the marbles do their work, or click a circle to manually fill it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play until space runs out and the level ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make strategic choices in the skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a level is over, it\u2019s time to spend your remaining marbles in the skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose for each token color critical skills that will change the way you play : boost, automate, multiply\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do keep a few marbles for the next level ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own neon aesthetic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own color palette or pick among preselected themes, whether for accessibility or maximum visual satisfaction.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release a marble so that it fills circle after circle with glowing light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the light particles to win points, then use these points to buy more marbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the marbles do their work, or click a circle to manually fill it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play until space runs out and the level ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make strategic choices in the skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a level is over, it\u2019s time to spend your remaining marbles in the skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose for each token color critical skills that will change the way you play : boost, automate, multiply\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do keep a few marbles for the next level ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own neon aesthetic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own color palette or pick among preselected themes, whether for accessibility or maximum visual satisfaction.</p>",
